  "sec-pilaunch-title":"Pi Launchpad — Goobta Bilowga Tokens",
  "sec-pilaunch-sub":"Pi Launchpad Testnet waxaa la bilaabay Maarso 2025. Dhig Pi, ballan-qaad Pi, kuna hel tokens cusub.",
