"faq-q1":"Pi Network kyauta ce don shiga?","faq-a1":"Ee — kyauta gaba ɗaya. Yi amfani da lambar tuntuba chigalex1 a minepi.com/chigalex1.",
"faq-q2":"Ina buƙatar ci gaba da app ta buɗe don haƙa?","faq-a2":"A'a. Danna maɓallin walƙiya sau ɗaya a kowace sa'o'i 24. Haka kawai.",
"faq-q3":"Menene GCV kuma shin hukuma ne?","faq-a3":"GCV (Global Consensus Value) lamba ce daga al'umma ta $314,159 akan 1π. Ba darajar hukuma ta Pi Network ba ce kuma Babban Kungiyar Pi bai tabbatar da ita ba tukuna.",
"faq-q4":"Me zan samu don kuɗin mambobi na 0.01π?","faq-a4":"Damar har abada ta: AI Chatbot, Horaswar KYC/KYB, Taswirar Pi, Jerin Masu Saye da Siyar.",
